SUMMARY:In The Other Room: Brendan Donegan
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 3070 Windward Plaza\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Brendan is a rising stand-up comedian known for his charismatic
  stage presence\, quick punchlines\, and honest\, self-aware storytelling. 
 Brendan started comedy in Philadelphia but now splits his time performing r
 egularly in both Philly and New York. Brendan draws his material from his e
 veryday life\, family chaos\, and questionable decision-making to craft jok
 es that feel personal and universally relatable. His approachable\, fast-pa
 ced\, and authentic comedy style helps him standout in any lineup.Brendan r
 egularly features and headlines all over the Northeast. He is a regular at 
 New York Comedy Club and Helium and Punchline in Philadelphia. He was a fin
 alist in New York Comedy Club’s stand up competition and the 1st runner u
 p in Helium Comedy Club’s Philly’s Phunniest competition in 2024. Brend
 an’s stand up has been featured on TruTV and Sirius XM\, and he has perfo
 rmed at festivals such as the Red Clay Comedy Festival\, Rogue Island Comed
 y Festival\, and has showcased for Netflix is a Joke and JFL independently.
